{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-compute-separation","title":"存算分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations/storage-compute-separation","wordCount":1670,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"存算分离\">存算分离</h1><p>假设你周一要跑一个全量回填任务，需要 200 台机器算 6 小时；周二到周日只有零星查询，10 台机器就够。在存储和计算耦合的架构里，你为了那 6 小时的高峰必须长期持有 200 台机器，因为数据就钉在那些机器的本地盘上，关机就读不到。存算分离要解决的正是这种&quot;为峰值买单&quot;的浪费——把数据放在独立的对象存储里，计算节点变成无状态、可随时起停的临时资源。这是湖仓相对于 Hadoop 时代最重要的架构跃迁，<a href=\"data-lake-concepts\">数据湖概念与演进</a> 里提到的从 HDFS 到 S3 的迁移，本质上就是这次跃迁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>存算分离（separation of storage and compute）指的是把&quot;数据持久化&quot;和&quot;数据处理&quot;两个职责拆到独立、可各自伸缩的层。存储层是对象存储（S3/GCS/Azure Blob），负责持久、廉价、近乎无限地保存字节；计算层是按需启动的查询引擎集群，负责把字节读出来算，算完即可释放。两层之间通过网络读取，靠对象存储的高吞吐和列式格式的列裁剪来弥补失去的数据本地性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[对象存储&lt;br/&gt;S3 / GCS / Blob] --&gt; B[计算集群 1&lt;br/&gt;Spark 批处理]&#10;  A --&gt; C[计算集群 2&lt;br/&gt;Trino 即席查询]&#10;  A --&gt; D[计算集群 3&lt;br/&gt;Flink 流处理]&#10;  B --&gt; A&#10;  C --&gt; E[BI 工具]&#10;  D --&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[对象存储&lt;br/&gt;S3 / GCS / Blob] --&gt; B[计算集群 1&lt;br/&gt;Spark 批处理]\n  A --&gt; C[计算集群 2&lt;br/&gt;Trino 即席查询]\n  A --&gt; D[计算集群 3&lt;br/&gt;Flink 流处理]\n  B --&gt; A\n  C --&gt; E[BI 工具]\n  D --&gt; A</pre><p>注意图里所有计算集群读的是<strong>同一份</strong>对象存储数据。这是存算分离最关键的红利：一份数据，多引擎共享，互不干扰。下表对比耦合与分离两种范式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>存算耦合（HDFS）</th>\n<th>存算分离（对象存储）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩容粒度</td>\n<td>整机（存储+计算捆绑）</td>\n<td>各自独立扩容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>差（有状态、关机丢访问）</td>\n<td>强（无状态、秒级起停）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据本地性</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无（靠网络+列裁剪弥补）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多引擎共享</td>\n<td>难</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本模型</td>\n<td>为峰值长期持有</td>\n<td>按需付费</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分离也不是免费的\">分离也不是免费的</h3><p>存算分离常被说成&quot;只有好处&quot;，但它同样引入了新的代价，选型时要一并权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代价</th>\n<th>具体表现</th>\n<th>缓解方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络成瓶颈</td>\n<td>每次读取跨网络拉数据，失去数据本地性</td>\n<td>列裁剪、分区裁剪、本地缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目录操作放大</td>\n<td>对象存储的 LIST、重命名慢且计费</td>\n<td>依赖表格式元数据清单，少列目录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小规模不划算</td>\n<td>几十 GB 简单查询时访问开销可能超过本地读</td>\n<td>单机引擎或轻量部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性语义更弱</td>\n<td>对象不可变、只能写新文件，不能原地改</td>\n<td>所有写路径走&quot;新文件+原子切换&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最容易被低估的是第四条：它不仅是一种性能代价，更直接塑造了上层框架的设计——<a href=\"../table-formats/open-table-formats\">开放表格式</a> 之所以采用&quot;写新文件+原子切换元数据指针&quot;而非&quot;原地改文件&quot;，根源就在于对象存储不允许原地修改。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对象存储为何成为地基\">对象存储为何成为地基</h2><p>对象存储和文件系统在心智模型上很不一样：它没有真正的目录树，只有扁平的键值空间，key 是字符串、value 是不可变的对象（blob）。这个看似简陋的模型恰恰带来了海量扩展能力——没有 NameNode 这样的中心元数据瓶颈，桶可以装下 EB 级数据。它的单价极低（冷存储每 GB 每月可以低到几分钱），持久性高（S3 标准存储设计为 11 个 9，即 99.999999999% 的年持久性）。</p>\n<p>对象存储的代价是它的语义弱：对象不可原地修改（要改只能整体覆写），列目录（LIST）操作慢且昂贵，过去还有最终一致性问题（S3 已于 2020 年底转为强读写一致）。这些弱语义直接影响了 <a href=\"../table-formats/open-table-formats\">开放表格式</a> 的设计——比如为什么表格式选择&quot;写新文件+原子切换元数据指针&quot;而不是&quot;原地改文件&quot;，正是因为对象不可变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"弹性与成本模型\">弹性与成本模型</h2><p>存算分离把成本模型从&quot;容量×时间&quot;重构成了&quot;用多少算多少&quot;。存储成本随数据量线性增长，但单价极低；计算成本只在任务运行时产生，任务结束就归零。这让两类优化成为可能：其一是<strong>自动伸缩</strong>，根据队列里的查询负载动态增减计算节点；其二是<strong>多集群隔离</strong>，给 BI、ETL、数据科学各开独立计算集群，互不抢资源，却共享同一份存储。</p>\n<p>可以用一个简化模型刻画节省。设峰值需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{peak}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个计算单元、平均只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{avg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，耦合架构必须长期持有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{peak}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而分离架构平均只付 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{avg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则计算成本节省比例约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>saving</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{saving} = 1 - \\frac{N_{avg}}{N_{peak}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">saving</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于典型的&quot;白天忙、夜里闲&quot;或&quot;月底跑批&quot;型负载，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{avg}/N_{peak}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">ak</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常常低于 0.3，意味着 70% 以上的计算成本可以省下。这正是 Snowflake、BigQuery、以及所有湖仓引擎都采用存算分离的经济学根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对查询性能的影响与补偿\">对查询性能的影响与补偿</h2><p>失去数据本地性后，每次查询都要从对象存储经网络拉数据，听起来是性能倒退。实践中靠几条机制补偿回来：<strong>列式格式的列裁剪</strong>（只读查询用到的列，详见 <a href=\"../engines/file-formats-parquet\">Parquet 与 ORC</a>）大幅减少传输量；<strong>分区裁剪和文件级统计信息</strong>（由 <a href=\"../table-formats/open-table-formats\">表格式</a> 的元数据提供）让引擎跳过无关文件；<strong>本地缓存层</strong>把热数据缓存在计算节点的本地 SSD 上，重复查询不再回源。这三条加起来，使得分离架构在多数分析负载上的性能已经追平甚至超过耦合架构，因为对象存储的聚合吞吐其实非常高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>存算分离把&quot;持久化&quot;和&quot;处理&quot;拆成可独立伸缩的两层，破解了存算耦合&quot;为峰值长期买单&quot;的浪费。</li>\n<li>对象存储以海量扩展、极低单价、11 个 9 持久性成为地基；其&quot;对象不可变&quot;的弱语义直接塑造了表格式的设计。</li>\n<li>弹性与按需付费让计算成本从&quot;容量×时间&quot;变为&quot;用多少算多少&quot;，典型负载可省 70% 以上计算成本。</li>\n<li>失去数据本地性靠列裁剪、分区裁剪、本地缓存三招补偿，分离架构在分析负载上已不输耦合架构。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：AWS S3 持久性与一致性官方文档；Dremio《Open Source and the Data Lakehouse》；Snowflake/BigQuery 存算分离架构白皮书。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"存算分离","id":"存算分离"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"分离也不是免费的","id":"分离也不是免费的"},{"level":2,"text":"对象存储为何成为地基","id":"对象存储为何成为地基"},{"level":2,"text":"弹性与成本模型","id":"弹性与成本模型"},{"level":2,"text":"对查询性能的影响与补偿","id":"对查询性能的影响与补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数仓、数据湖与湖仓对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/foundations/warehouse-lake-lakehouse"},"next":{"title":"开放表格式概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-lakehouse-architecture/table-formats/open-table-formats"}}